  "description": "Long ago a king found a relic to protect the peace in his war torn realm. If it was opened, chaos would beset the realm once more. As a safeguard to protect it, a group of warriors called the Mayabi were called to protect it at all times and at all costs. Many generations have passed, and the relic disappeared. The last Mayabi has now embarked upon a quest to retrieve the reliquary and bring peace to the land once more.",
